W:
W:By a lonely prison wall, I heard a young girl calling
W:"Michael, they have taken you away,
W:For you stole Trevelyan's corn,
W:So the young might see the morn.
W:Now a prison ship lies waiting in the bay."
W:
W:Low lie the fields of Athenry
